      "commandLine": "*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: xsv_port.py\n@@\n     if typ in (\"Integer\", \"Float\"):\n         population = numbers + ([0.0] * (len(values) - len(nonempty)) if include_nulls else [])\n         if population:\n-            mean = sum(population) / len(population)\n-            variance = sum((x - mean) ** 2 for x in population) / len(population)\n-            result.extend([rust_float(mean), rust_float(math.sqrt(variance))])\n+            count, mean, squared = 0, 0.0, 0.0\n+            for number in population:\n+                count += 1\n+                delta = number - mean\n+                mean += delta / count\n+                squared += delta * (number - mean)\n+            result.extend([rust_float(mean), rust_float(math.sqrt(squared / count))])\n*** End Patch",
